{"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/cache(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/cache(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cache","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Query","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule5QueryV"},{"text":"<repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">)","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"cache(_:)","remoteSource":{"fileName":"QueryCache.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/QueryCache.swift#L127"},"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"extendedModule":"WorldModule","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A0V5cacheyyAA5QueryVyxxQp_QPGRvzAA0D4TermRzlF","symbolKind":"method"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a list of the entities that match a query’s structure, so that queries and updates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the same conditions visit only those entities."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cache","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"query"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule5QueryV","text":"Query"},{"kind":"text","text":"<repeat each "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"T"},{"text":">) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"QueryTerm","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9QueryTermP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"query","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The query whose matching entities to keep."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A query normally walks the storage of one of its types and checks every entity there"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"against the rest of its conditions. When few of those entities match, most of that walk is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wasted. A cached query keeps the matching entities in a list of their own, kept current as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you spawn, insert, remove and despawn, so a visit can walk that list instead."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use a cache for a query you run often whose conditions exclude most of the entities it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"would otherwise walk, such as the few entities that are awake among many asleep:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct Asleep: Component {}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"code":["var world = World()","let awake = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0))","let sleeper = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0), Asleep())","","world.cache(Query(Position.self, Velocity.self).without(Asleep.self))","","world.update(Position.self, reading: Velocity.self, where: .without(Asleep.self)) { position, row in","    position.x += row.components.dx","}","print(world[Position.self, of: awake].x, world[Position.self, of: sleeper].x)","\/\/ Prints \"1.0 0.0\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The cache holds the entities that hold every component term of ","type":"text"},{"code":"query","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and every type its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"filter requires, hold none of the types it excludes or skips by default (such as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Disabled","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), and pass its groups of alternatives that name no change ticks. A query or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"update uses the cache when its own conditions imply the cache’s: it requires every type the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cache requires, excludes every type the cache excludes, and has the same groups of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"alternatives. It walks the cache only when the cache is smaller than the storage it would","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"otherwise walk. A cache never changes which entities a visit finds, only how it finds them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" terms, change-tick filters and relation filters don’t narrow the cache; a visit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still checks them for each cached entity. Caching the same conditions twice keeps one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cache. A copy of the world keeps its caches; a snapshot doesn’t."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"Complexity","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O("},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":"·"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"t","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":") for "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" entities in the smallest required type, or every live"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity when the query requires none, and "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"t"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" conditions. Each cache adds O("},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"t","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":") to adding"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or removing a component of a type it names."}]}],"type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/group(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/group(checked:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/index(_:)-u1gw","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/index(_:)-2gtfg","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/lookup(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/lookup(_:equals:)"],"title":"Speeding Up Queries","anchor":"Speeding-Up-Queries","generated":true}],"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/QueryTerm":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A type that can be a term of a query, deciding which entities match and what the query reads","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from each.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"QueryTerm","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/queryterm","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"QueryTerm"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"QueryTerm"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/